<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0710_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Walt</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0710_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mostly I breathe fire, but you wanna\nswap numbers? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0710_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight!\rDon’t trip. I’ll stop breathin’ fire\nwhile we on the phone...\fso gimme a call sometime!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0710_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I knew us Firebreathers wasn’t\nexactly popular...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0710_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh!\nYou wanna breathe fire with me?\r...Oh, you don’t.\rYou wanna swap numbers\nwith me after all? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0710_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s aight.\nI promise I won’t burn you, so you can\fcome talk to me in person.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0710_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know, a lotta people\nget it twisted.\rMight look like us Firebreathers use\nfire to scare our homies while\ftrainin’ ’em.\rBut that ain’t it at all!\nWe just train our homies normal!\fAin’t that right, {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0}?\rBreathin’ fire just a hobby!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0710_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Buoahhhbobobo!\rWhat you think?\nI found a new technique\ffor breathin’ fire!\rWell, not like you can tell over\nthe phone...\rNever mind that. I caught a wild\n{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} yesterday.\rI think I’mma start trainin’ it soon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0710_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You like {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}?\rAs for me...they aight. There’s\nall kinds of stuff in this world.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0710_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Buoahhhbobobo!\nToday a GREAT day!\rYou should scrap me again!\nI’m waitin’ and practicin’ on\f{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0710_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m all ready, and waitin’ for you on\n{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}, so hurry up!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0710_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know how there’s SO many\ndifferent types of homies, right?\rEvery type got good points and bad\npoints, so it ain’t easy to say which\ftype is the best.\rHowever...\rMy pick GOTTA be Fire!\fBuoahhhbobobo!!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0710_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know today the\nBug-Catching Contest?\rI ain’t that into Bug types,\nbut the National Park ain’t that far\ffrom Route 35...\fI might go check it out.</language>
	</row>
</body>
